  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## What's Changed\n### V6.4.7:\n* Detect devices for exist brands\n* Improves detection for ChromeOS\n* Detect new brands: G-Vill, Vitumi and Detect devices for exist brands\n* Detect new brands: Fanvace, GlobalSec, VASOUN and Detect devices for exist brands\n* Improves detection for LineageOS\n* Adds detection for KolibriOS and LibHTTP\n* Adds detection for Microsoft Power Automate\n* Adds detection for QuarkPC and Quetta browsers\n* Detect new brands: ACD, RunGee, YIKEMI and Detect devices for exist brands\n* Adds detection for WeCom\n* Add detection for Seekr iOS and Android user-agents\n* Detect new brand: CALME and Detect devices for exist brands\n* Detect new brands: Eplutus, waipu.tv, ZALA and Detect devices for exist brands\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/totpero/DeviceDetector.NET/compare/v6.4.6...v6.4.7",
